%% 시퀀스 다이어그램 1: 정상 주문 흐름 (장바구니 → 주문 → 결제 성공)
sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Member
    participant API as Shopping API
    participant DB as Database
    participant PaymentGW as Payment GW (Mock)
    participant ShippingSystem as Shipping System

    Note over M,ShippingSystem: 시나리오 1: 정상 주문 흐름

    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
    Note over M,API: 1단계: 장바구니 담기
    M->>API: POST /cart {product_id: 1, qty: 2}
    API->>DB: SELECT product WHERE id=1
    DB-->>API: {id: 1, name: 노트북, current_price: 1,000,000, stock: 10}
    API->>DB: INSERT cart_item {product_id: 1, qty: 2, price_at_add_time: 1,000,000}
    API-->>M: {cart_item_id: 101}
    end

    rect rgb(200, 255, 220)
    Note over M,API: 2단계: 주문 생성 (핵심 - 원자적 처리)
    M->>API: POST /orders {items: [{product_id: 1, qty: 2}], address: "서울시...", phone: "010-..."}
    
    API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    
    par 재고 확인 (동시성 제어)
        API->>DB: SELECT stock FROM product WHERE id=1 FOR UPDATE [Pessimistic Lock]
        DB-->>API: stock = 10
    and 재고 충분?
        API->>API: qty(2) <= stock(10)? YES ✅
    end
    
    par 원자적 처리 (Atomic)
        API->>DB: INSERT order {id: 1, member_id: 100, status: '결제대기', total_amount: 2,000,000}
        API->>DB: INSERT order_item {order_id: 1, product_id: 1, qty: 2, confirmed_price: 1,000,000}
        API->>DB: UPDATE product SET stock = 10 - 2 = 8
        API->>DB: DELETE FROM cart_item WHERE member_id=100
    end
    
    API->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB-->>API: success
    API-->>M: {order_id: 1, status: '결제대기', total_amount: 2,000,000}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 220, 200)
    Note over M,API: 3단계: 결제 처리
    M->>PaymentGW: Mock 결제 선택 (성공)
    PaymentGW-->>M: {payment_id: PAY-001, status: completed}
    
    M->>API: POST /orders/1/payment {payment_id: PAY-001}
    API->>DB: UPDATE order SET status='결제완료'
    API-->>M: {order_id: 1, status: '결제완료'}
    end

    Note over M,API: 주문 완료 ✅

---

%% 시퀀스 다이어그램 2: 결제 실패 (재고 자동 복원)
sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Member
    participant API as Shopping API
    participant DB as Database
    participant PaymentGW as Payment GW (Mock)

    Note over M,PaymentGW: 시나리오 2: 결제 실패 처리 (재고 복원)

    rect rgb(255, 220, 200)
    Note over M,API: 주문은 성공했으나 결제 실패
    M->>API: POST /orders {items: [...]}
    API->>DB: [주문 생성 + 재고 차감: 10 → 8]
    DB-->>API: {order_id: 1, status: '결제대기', stock: 8}
    API-->>M: order_id: 1 생성됨
    end

    rect rgb(255, 150, 150)
    Note over M,API: 결제 실패 → 자동 롤백
    M->>PaymentGW: Mock 결제 선택 (실패)
    PaymentGW-->>M: {status: failed, message: "카드 거절"}
    
    M->>API: POST /orders/1/payment (실패 알림)
    
    API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    
    par 재고 자동 복원 (Rollback)
        API->>DB: SELECT order_item FROM order_item WHERE order_id=1
        API->>DB: FOR EACH order_item: UPDATE product SET stock = stock + item.qty
        Note over DB: stock: 8 → 10 (완전히 복원!)
    end
    
    par 주문 상태 변경
        API->>DB: UPDATE order SET status='취소완료'
    end
    
    API->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB-->>API: success
    
    API-->>M: {order_id: 1, status: '취소완료', refund_amount: 2,000,000}
    end

    Note over M,API: 재고 복구 완료 ✅ (자동)

